OL,3,AKate Hudson to make How to Lose a Guy
OL,4,Ain 10 Days sequel, 23 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sequel to How to Lose a Guy In 10
OL,7,FDays is in development, more than 20
OL,8,Fyears after the original hit rom-com
OL,9,Fwas released, with original star Kate
OL,10,FHudson set to produce.
OL,12,FWork on the film is in the "very early
OL,13,Fdays", with sources telling US media
OL,14,Fthat both Hudson, 47, and Matthew
OL,15,FMcConaughey, 56, could reprise their
OL,16,Froles from the first film.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
