OL,3,AKate Hudson to make How to Lose a Guy
OL,4,Ain 10 Days sequel, 23 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the original, Hudson played a
OL,7,Fmagazine journalist called Andie who
OL,8,Fresearches an article about modern
OL,9,Fdating. She convinces her boss she can
OL,10,Fget a man, Benjamin (McConaughey), to
OL,11,Fleave her in 10 days. Meanwhile,
OL,12,FBenjamin bets his boss he can make any
OL,13,Fwoman fall for him, with Andie his
OL,14,Ftarget.
OL,16,FHudson will produce the sequel
OL,17,Falongside Stacey Sher, who is behind
OL,18,Fhits such as Pulp Fiction and Matilda.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
