OL,3,ARussian stadium says it won't host
OL,4,AKanye West gigs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Russian stadium that was scheduled
OL,7,Fto host two shows by Ye, the rapper
OL,8,Falso known as Kanye West, has said the
OL,9,Fevents will no longer take place.
OL,11,FIn a social media post, St Petersburg's
OL,12,FGazprom Arena said no rental agreement
OL,13,Fhad been signed with the concert
OL,14,Fpromoters. "Accordingly, the concert
OL,15,Fcannot take place on our site."
OL,17,FWest would have been the first major
OL,18,FWestern performer to play Russia since
OL,19,Fit invaded Ukraine in 2022. The rapper
OL,20,Fis trying to rehabilitate his image
OL,21,Fafter years of antisemitic remarks, for
OL,22,Fwhich he recently apologised.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
